WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
The first night kiddush has an ordered

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.020
sequence.

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:05.540
Prepare the correct sidur beforehand.

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:08.680
A clear cue and response reduce confusion

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:10.120
without changing the ritual.
